e>8</BitSize><BitOffs>192</BitOffs></SubItem><SubItem><Name>StartTime</Name><Type>TIME</Type><BitSize>32</BitSize><BitOffs>224</BitOffs></SubItem><Properties><Property><Name>PouType</Name><Value>FunctionBlock</Value></Property></Properties></DataType><DataType><Name>FB_Barrier</Name><Comment><![CDATA[ L4a — Barrier (závora) control.
 State machine: IDLE → BLOCKED → LIFTING → IDLE
 Trigger sensor depends on direction of travel:
   KLADNY (forward) : lower on SP1 (HRA_LEV) rising edge, raise on SP2 (HRA_ZAV) falling edge
   OPACNY (reverse) : lower on SP2 (HRA_ZAV) rising edge, raise on SP1 (HRA_LEV) falling edge
   Unknown direction: lower on whichever sensor triggers first (safe default).
 Runs only when inEnable = TRUE (set by FB_MachineControl).
 In manual mode (inEnable=FALSE, inManEnable=TRUE) manual command passes through.]]></Comment><BitSize>1728</BitSize><SubItem><Name>inEnable</Name><Type>BOOL</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ TRUE = auto mode active]]></Comment><BitSize>8</BitSize><BitOffs>64</BitOffs><Properties><Property><Name>ItemType</Name><Value>Input</Value></Property></Properties></SubItem><SubItem><Name>inManEnable</Name><Type>BOOL</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ TRUE = manual mode active (from FB_MachineControl.outEnable_Man)]]></Comment><BitSize>8</BitSize><BitOffs>72</BitOffs><Properties><Property><Name>ItemType</Name><Value>Input</Value></Property></Properties></SubItem><SubItem><Name>inClearFault</Name><Type>BOOL</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ TRUE for one scan when CLEARING state entered (from MAIN rClearing.Q)]]></Comment><BitSize>8</BitSize><BitOffs>80</BitOffs><Properties><Property><Name>ItemType</Name><Value>Input</Value></Property></Properties></SubItem><SubItem><Name>inSP1</Name><Type>BOOL</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ Hradlo levé — vozidlo přítomno (HRA_LEV)]]></Comment><BitSize>8</BitSize><BitOffs>88</BitOffs><Properties><Property><Name>ItemType</Name><Value>Input</Value></Property></Properties></SubItem><SubItem><Name>inSP2</Name><Type>BOOL</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ Hradlo závor — vozidlo přítomno (HRA_ZAV)]]></Comment><BitSize>8</BitSize><BitOffs>96</BitOffs><Properties><Property><Name>ItemType</Name><Value>Input</Value></Property></Properties></SubItem><SubItem><Name>inKLADNY</Name><Type>BOOL</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ Směr jízdy: kupředu (kladný)]]></Comment><BitSize>8</BitSize><BitOffs>104</BitOffs><Properties><Property><Name>ItemType</Name><Value>Input</Value></Property></Properties></SubItem><SubItem><Name>inOPACNY</Name><Type>BOOL</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ Směr jízdy: pozpátku (opačný)]]></Comment><BitSize>8</BitSize><BitOffs>112</BitOffs><Properties><Property><Name>ItemType</Name><Value>Input</Value></Property></Properties></SubItem><SubItem><Name>inJIZDA</Name><Type>BOOL</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ PL