 Responsibilities:
   - Combine HW + SCADA inputs and detect edges.
   - Handle E-STOP and child FB faults (highest priority, interrupt any state).
   - Call the active state FB each cycle (bExecute := TRUE).
   - Read outCmd from the active state FB and perform the transition.
   - Forward outputs (enables, init signals) from the active state FB.

 Each state FB owns:
   - Its own logic, timers, sub-machines.
   - Resetting its internals when bExecute goes FALSE.
   - Deciding WHEN to transition (via outCmd).
 MachineControl decides IF the transition is allowed and updates eState.]]></Comment><BitSize>4864</BitSize><SubItem><Name>inBTN_Start</Name><Type>BOOL</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ --- HW buttons (TRUE = pressed) ---]]></Comment><BitSize>8</BitSize><BitOffs>64</BitOffs><Properties><Property><Name>ItemType</Name><Value>Input</Value></Property></Properties></SubItem><SubItem><Name>inBTN_Reset</Name><Type>BOOL</Type><BitSize>8</BitSize><BitOffs>72</BitOffs><Properties><Property><Name>ItemType</Name><Value>Input</Value></Property></Properties></SubItem><SubItem><Name>inBTN_Stop</Name><Type>BOOL</Type><BitSize>8</BitSize><BitOffs>80</BitOffs><Properties><Property><Name>ItemType</Name><Value>Input</Value></Property></Properties></SubItem><SubItem><Name>inBTN_Man</Name><Type>BOOL</Type><BitSize>8</BitSize><BitOffs>88</BitOffs><Properties><Property><Name>ItemType</Name><Value>Input</Value></Property></Properties></SubItem><SubItem><Name>inBTN_EStop</Name><Type>BOOL</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ NC — TRUE = safe, FALSE = E-STOP active]]></Comment><BitSize>8</BitSize><BitOffs>96</BitOffs><Properties><Property><Name>ItemType</Name><Value>Input</Value></Property></Properties></SubItem><SubItem><Name>inSCADA_Start</Name><Type>BOOL</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ %M100.0]]></Comment><BitSize>8</BitSize><BitOffs>104</BitOffs><Properties><Property><Name>ItemType</Name><Value>Input</Value></Property></Properties></SubItem><SubItem><Name>inSCADA_Reset</Name><Type>BOOL</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ %M100.1]]></Comment><BitSize>8</BitSize><BitOffs>112</BitOffs><Properties><Property><Name>ItemType</Name><Value>Input</Value></Property></Properties></SubItem><SubItem><Name>inSCADA_Stop</Name><Type>BOOL</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ %M100.2]]></Comment><BitSize>8</BitSize><BitOffs>120</BitOffs><Properties><Property><Name>ItemType</Name><Value>Input</Value></Property></Properties></SubItem><SubItem><Name>inSCADA_Man</Name><Type>BOOL</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ %M100.3]]></Comment><BitSize>8</BitSize><BitOffs>128</BitOf